            "body": "{\"articles\":[{\"author_id\":39771704393373,\"body\":\"We create furniture that mirrors the diversity and richness of the world. Our furniture represents a blend of cultures, techniques, and materials. Whether it’s the meticulous precision of Scandinavian design, the robust durability of American craftsmanship, or the elegant simplicity of Japanese aesthetics, each piece tells its own story. This is why we collaborate with skilled artisans and manufacturers, who each contribute their unique craftsmanship and expertise to our collections.<p>Our three best-selling collections are Minimalist Elegance, Urban Chic, and Zen Harmony.</p><p>Crafted in the heart of Denmark, a country renowned for its sleek, modern designs, <b>Minimalist Elegance</b> is the epitome for which Scandinavian design is known. Our team regularly visits to ensure functional simplicity that will work for homes around the world.</p><p>The <b>Urban Chic</b> line originates in the bustling factories of North Carolina in the U.S. The robust, practical designs are a testament to American craftsmanship. Regular visits to these factories allow our team to maintain a hands-on approach, so that every piece meets our high standards of quality and durability.</p><p>The <b>Zen Harmony</b> collection is crafted in Osaka, Japan. It reflects the simple, sophisticated grace that has brought fame to Japanese furniture. Our team’s regular visits to Osaka ensure this aesthetic in every item.</p><p>Although our production is a global endeavor, we remain committed to ensuring affordability. By offering direct-to-consumer payment plans, we make it easier for you to bring these world-class designs into your home.</p>\",\"comments_disabled\":false,\"content_tag_ids\":[],\"created_at\":\"2026-10-08T21:14:22Z\",\"draft\":false,\"edited_at\":\"2026-10-08T21:14:22Z\",\"html_url\":\"https://stealth-37618.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/39771682143261-SAMPLE-ARTICLE-Made-with-care-around-the-world\",\"id\":39771682143261,\"label_names\":[],\"locale\":\"en-us\",\"name\":\"SAMPLE ARTICLE: Made with care around the world\",\"outdated\":false,\"outdated_locales\":[],\"permission_group_id\":39771696447005,\"position\":0,\"promoted\":true,\"section_id\":39771706390941,\"source_locale\":\"en-us\",\"title\":\"SAMPLE ARTICLE: Made with care around the world\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-08T21:14:22Z\",\"url\":\"https://stealth-37618.zendesk.com/api/v2/help_center/en-us/articles/39771682143261.json\",\"user_segment_id\":null,\"vote_count\":0,\"vote_sum\":0}],\"count\":12,\"end_time\":1791494063,\"next_page\":\"https://stealth-37618.zendesk.com/hc/api/v2/incremental/articles.json?per_page=1&start_time=1791494063\"}",
